2975	Drupal is an open source platform for building amazing digital experiences. It’s made, used, taught, documented, and marketed by the <a href="@drupal_community">Drupal community</a>. Our community is made up of people from around the world with a shared set of <a href="@drupal_values">values</a>, collaborating together in a respectful manner. As we like to say:		11.4.7
2976	Come for the code, stay for the community.		11.4.7
